<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners big buyers of S.African bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners big buyers of S.African bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 709.33 million rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Jan 17  Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		6,079.10	 11,970.85</p>
<p>    - sales		    5,369.76	 11,357.52</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)  709.33	    613.34</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
